3096
01:34:56,520 --> 01:34:57,800
is very playful.

3097
01:34:59,360 --> 01:35:00,880
All the models are also walking...

3098
01:35:00,880 --> 01:35:01,280
Yeah.

3099
01:35:01,280 --> 01:35:02,080
Very briskly.

3100
01:35:02,080 --> 01:35:03,240
It's starting over.

3101
01:35:03,240 --> 01:35:03,640
Yes.

3102
01:35:04,240 --> 01:35:05,200
What is the name?

3103
01:35:05,680 --> 01:35:06,240
It's called

3104
01:35:06,760 --> 01:35:07,320
"Rebirth".

3105
01:35:23,520 --> 01:35:24,440
Honglei has started dancing.

3106
01:35:24,440 --> 01:35:25,400
Honglei is dancing.

3107
01:35:33,320 --> 01:35:33,840
Good.

3108
01:35:33,840 --> 01:35:34,320
Groovy.

3109
01:35:41,840 --> 01:35:42,680
Look at Yuning.

3110
01:35:46,360 --> 01:35:48,120
He looks like a designer
showing up at the end.

3111
01:35:57,160 --> 01:35:58,800
Isn't that exactly the designer's vibe?

3112
01:35:58,800 --> 01:36:00,440
It's like, "Thank you
for coming to my show."

3113
01:36:04,000 --> 01:36:04,800
Pretty good.

3114
01:36:04,800 --> 01:36:06,240
This way, the whole show
won't feel dull.

3115
01:36:06,240 --> 01:36:07,080
Not bad.

3116
01:36:20,000 --> 01:36:20,640
It's fun.

3117
01:36:20,640 --> 01:36:21,480
It's fun.

3118
01:36:23,160 --> 01:36:24,200
Have you ever walked a show?

3119
01:36:24,200 --> 01:36:24,680
No.

3120
01:36:24,680 --> 01:36:25,160
Me neither.

3121
01:36:25,160 --> 01:36:25,600
I never have.

3122
01:36:25,600 --> 01:36:26,760
But I think it's very fun.

3123
01:36:26,760 --> 01:36:28,200
I find both sides' creativity

3124
01:36:28,200 --> 01:36:29,440
equally interesting.

3125
01:36:29,440 --> 01:36:30,280
I also think it's very fun.

3126
01:36:30,496 --> 01:36:33,056
(Second group returns for thanks)

3127
01:37:08,720 --> 01:37:09,520
Say hi to the camera.

3128
01:37:26,520 --> 01:37:27,320
Okay.

3129
01:37:27,320 --> 01:37:28,520
Okay, come on.

3130
01:37:28,520 --> 01:37:30,640
Three, two, one.

3131
01:37:41,024 --> 01:37:43,776
(Designers taking a bow)

3132
01:37:59,240 --> 01:38:00,400
Today,

3133
01:38:00,400 --> 01:38:02,680
all the Earth Group members

3134
01:38:02,680 --> 01:38:04,640
received the mission

3135
01:38:04,640 --> 01:38:05,640
in a very short

3136
01:38:05,640 --> 01:38:06,160
time.

3137
01:38:06,160 --> 01:38:07,800
And then in a very short time,

3138
01:38:08,120 --> 01:38:09,640
we completed all the rehearsals,

3139
01:38:09,640 --> 01:38:10,480
including

3140
01:38:10,760 --> 01:38:12,720
song selection and coordination.

3141
01:38:12,720 --> 01:38:14,240
I can really feel

3142
01:38:14,240 --> 01:38:16,640
that in a very rushed

3143
01:38:16,640 --> 01:38:17,480
atmosphere,

3144
01:38:17,480 --> 01:38:18,560
everyone

3145
01:38:18,560 --> 01:38:20,800
worked hard to make the whole show

3146
01:38:21,200 --> 01:38:22,600
run well

3147
01:38:22,600 --> 01:38:23,440
in Paris

3148
01:38:23,760 --> 01:38:24,240
so that

3149
01:38:24,240 --> 01:38:26,760
more people in Paris

3150
01:38:26,760 --> 01:38:28,280
can see all our designers

3151
01:38:28,280 --> 01:38:30,080
and see what we've worked hard for.

3152
01:38:30,080 --> 01:38:30,640
Thank you.

3153
01:38:33,360 --> 01:38:36,520
I have never been to Paris.

3154
01:38:36,520 --> 01:38:38,120
I have never watched a show.

3155
01:38:38,120 --> 01:38:40,720
And I never thought
I would come to watch a show.

3156
01:38:41,120 --> 01:38:43,160
Because I always thought I was someone

3157
01:38:43,160 --> 01:38:44,280
who doesn't understand fashion.

3158
01:38:44,960 --> 01:38:46,000
I don't know what fashion is.

3159
01:38:46,000 --> 01:38:46,760
I just know

3160
01:38:46,760 --> 01:38:48,480
that the clothes I wear are comfortable.

3161
01:38:48,480 --> 01:38:49,360
But actually, today

3162
01:38:49,360 --> 01:38:50,480
has been my most anxious day.

3163
01:38:50,480 --> 01:38:51,160
Because

3164
01:38:51,880 --> 01:38:52,840
it...

3165
01:38:52,840 --> 01:38:53,360
All my...

3166
01:38:53,360 --> 01:38:54,760
All our upcoming

3167
01:38:54,760 --> 01:38:56,120
cooperation and actions

3168
01:38:56,120 --> 01:38:57,880
would not only represent us.

3169
01:38:57,880 --> 01:38:59,920
Because we'd carry other people's works

3170
01:38:59,920 --> 01:39:01,200
and efforts.

3171
01:39:01,200 --> 01:39:02,640
It might be their dreams.

3172
01:39:02,640 --> 01:39:03,920
So today,

3173
01:39:03,920 --> 01:39:05,880
in a very anxious situation,

3174
01:39:05,880 --> 01:39:07,400
we've completed

3175
01:39:07,400 --> 01:39:09,680
a show that we thought of by ourselves.

3176
01:39:10,400 --> 01:39:11,920
But after doing it, I feel

3177
01:39:12,880 --> 01:39:15,360
there's actually
a little sense of accomplishment.

3178
01:39:15,880 --> 01:39:17,120
Yes, I'm very happy.

3179
01:39:17,120 --> 01:39:19,080
Once again, thank you
to all these designers.

3180
01:39:19,080 --> 01:39:20,560
I am very honored to wear

3181
01:39:20,560 --> 01:39:21,800
I am very honored to wear

3182
01:39:21,800 --> 01:39:24,200
the clothes designed by you,
the great designers

3183
01:39:24,800 --> 01:39:25,400
in the future world.

3184
01:39:25,400 --> 01:39:25,880
Thank you.

3185
01:39:29,600 --> 01:39:31,800
Our theme wants to express

3186
01:39:31,800 --> 01:39:33,440
that when you live in this world

3187
01:39:33,440 --> 01:39:35,960
and work and live in society,

3188
01:39:35,960 --> 01:39:37,240
you will have many constraints.

3189
01:39:39,080 --> 01:39:40,880
(You will face many stereotypes.)

3190
01:39:41,760 --> 01:39:42,560
(The more careful you are,)

3191
01:39:42,560 --> 01:39:43,480
(sometimes you might)

3192
01:39:43,480 --> 01:39:45,520
(fall more accidentally.)

3193
01:39:47,280 --> 01:39:48,440
If we have a chance

3194
01:39:48,440 --> 01:39:49,440
to start over,

3195
01:39:49,440 --> 01:39:52,320
a chance to turn back time,

3196
01:39:52,320 --> 01:39:53,600
then what will we do?

3197
01:39:53,600 --> 01:39:54,640
Then we will definitely

3198
01:39:54,640 --> 01:39:56,560
enjoy life at will.

3199
01:39:56,560 --> 01:39:57,600
So we designed that part.

3200
01:39:57,600 --> 01:39:58,720
In the first part,

3201
01:39:58,720 --> 01:39:59,840
I fell down

3202
01:39:59,840 --> 01:40:00,800
(and stopped there.)

3203
01:40:00,800 --> 01:40:02,920
(And at first, I was scared,)

3204
01:40:02,920 --> 01:40:03,920
(not knowing how to get up.)

3205
01:40:03,920 --> 01:40:05,840
(Some people turned a blind eye to me)

3206
01:40:05,840 --> 01:40:07,320
(and passed by indifferently.)

3207
01:40:07,320 --> 01:40:08,600
(Some people glanced at me,)

3208
01:40:08,600 --> 01:40:09,400
(as if they cared,)

3209
01:40:09,400 --> 01:40:10,400
(but actually they didn't)

3210
01:40:10,400 --> 01:40:11,400
(really help me.)

3211
01:40:12,320 --> 01:40:17,000
(Until I used my time-reversing)

3212
01:40:17,000 --> 01:40:18,120
(ability.)

3213
01:40:20,040 --> 01:40:22,320
When everyone went back
to the very beginning

3214
01:40:22,320 --> 01:40:23,520
(Fate is not defined by other people's view,)
and started over,

3215
01:40:23,520 --> 01:40:25,080
(but the one who stands back up)
I came out as my vibrant self.

3216
01:40:25,080 --> 01:40:27,280
And everyone lived out
their most vibrant selves.

3217
01:40:27,280 --> 01:40:27,760
Yeah.

3218
01:40:27,760 --> 01:40:29,200
That's the concept.

3219
01:40:30,600 --> 01:40:30,800
Yeah.

3220
01:40:30,800 --> 01:40:31,360
This concept

3221
01:40:31,360 --> 01:40:32,600
came from all four of us

3222
01:40:32,600 --> 01:40:33,400
together.

3223
01:40:33,400 --> 01:40:34,080
Of course.

3224
01:40:34,080 --> 01:40:34,720
Together.

3225
01:40:34,720 --> 01:40:35,440
Yeah.

3226
01:40:35,440 --> 01:40:36,560
Our theme

3227
01:40:36,560 --> 01:40:38,680
is called "If Time Could Reverse,

3228
01:40:38,680 --> 01:40:40,320
I Want to Enjoy Life Once".

3229
01:40:40,320 --> 01:40:40,880
It's "Rebirth".

3230
01:40:43,280 --> 01:40:44,800
What a coincidence.

3231
01:40:44,800 --> 01:40:46,840
Our groups

3232
01:40:46,840 --> 01:40:47,920
rehearsed separately.

3233
01:40:47,920 --> 01:40:49,920
But after I watched your show,

3234
01:40:49,920 --> 01:40:51,120
I found together

3235
01:40:51,120 --> 01:40:53,680
we can make a very complete story.

3236
01:40:53,680 --> 01:40:54,880
It can be completely connected.

3237
01:40:55,320 --> 01:40:56,880
If yours is called "Rebirth",

3238
01:40:57,280 --> 01:40:58,680
ours is called "The Beginning".

3239
01:40:59,320 --> 01:41:00,240
Because they said

3240
01:41:00,240 --> 01:41:01,880
we needed a transition in the middle,

3241
01:41:01,880 --> 01:41:03,400
so we thought of something

3242
01:41:03,400 --> 01:41:05,320
to stall for time as the transition.

3243
01:41:05,320 --> 01:41:07,480
We used a thread and needle.

3244
01:41:08,120 --> 01:41:09,240
(First of all,)

3245
01:41:09,240 --> 01:41:11,320
(it's our tribute to all the designers)

3246
01:41:11,800 --> 01:41:13,520
(and to those who love beauty)

3247
01:41:13,520 --> 01:41:15,160
(and can discover beauty.)

3248
01:41:15,800 --> 01:41:18,280
(Secondly, I am a theater actor,)

3249
01:41:18,280 --> 01:41:19,400
(and we are all actors.)

3250
01:41:19,920 --> 01:41:21,200
(The pantomime practice)

3251
01:41:21,200 --> 01:41:22,320
(in the middle)

3252
01:41:22,320 --> 01:41:24,360
(is actually the most basic
exercise for actors)

3253
01:41:24,360 --> 01:41:25,920
(and also the hardest exercise.)

3254
01:41:26,360 --> 01:41:28,680
(It tests an actor's senses of belief,)

3255
01:41:28,680 --> 01:41:30,480
(texture, weight, and proportion.)

3256
01:41:30,480 --> 01:41:31,960
So I think

3257
01:41:31,960 --> 01:41:34,040
the name "The Beginning"
fits our theme well.

3258
01:41:34,040 --> 01:41:36,120
I think Chinese designers

3259
01:41:36,120 --> 01:41:37,880
never lack creativity.

3260
01:41:37,880 --> 01:41:39,840
I believe our cultural heritage

3261
01:41:39,840 --> 01:41:40,640
and our abilities

3262
01:41:40,640 --> 01:41:42,080
can definitely
let the world recognize us

3263
01:41:42,080 --> 01:41:43,360
and see us.

3264
01:41:48,320 --> 01:41:49,200
First,

3265
01:41:49,640 --> 01:41:50,840
I am very excited.

3266
01:41:51,200 --> 01:41:53,920
Just now backstage,
Qian and I were both...

3267
01:41:53,920 --> 01:41:54,320
I was like,

3268
01:41:55,880 --> 01:41:57,720
"Why is this kind of addictive?"

3269
01:41:58,600 --> 01:42:00,440
The runway and the stage

3270
01:42:00,440 --> 01:42:01,800
actually both have charm.

3271
01:42:02,160 --> 01:42:03,520
Actually, I am quite emotional

3272
01:42:03,520 --> 01:42:04,840
and also very excited.

3273
01:42:04,840 --> 01:42:05,720
Well,

3274
01:42:05,720 --> 01:42:06,880
because I can see you all.

3275
01:42:07,440 --> 01:42:09,120
You all carry

3276
01:42:09,120 --> 01:42:11,680
your dreams for fashion, clothing,

3277
01:42:11,680 --> 01:42:12,880
and art

3278
01:42:12,880 --> 01:42:13,960
and come to a foreign land.

3279
01:42:14,440 --> 01:42:16,600
I believe you love it.

3280
01:42:16,600 --> 01:42:17,280
At the same time,

3281
01:42:17,280 --> 01:42:18,560
I can also see

3282
01:42:19,080 --> 01:42:21,600
your own interpretation of fashion

3283
01:42:21,600 --> 01:42:23,480
and how you've incorporated

3284
01:42:23,480 --> 01:42:24,600
many of our Chinese elements

3285
01:42:24,600 --> 01:42:25,440
here.

3286
01:42:25,440 --> 01:42:26,120
So at this point,

3287
01:42:26,120 --> 01:42:27,720
I am really very happy.

3288
01:42:27,720 --> 01:42:29,560
I can see your confidence.

3289
01:42:30,440 --> 01:42:32,040
It's your confidence

3290
01:42:32,040 --> 01:42:34,320
that allows us to be on the runway

3291
01:42:34,320 --> 01:42:36,560
in the clothes you designed.

3292
01:42:36,560 --> 01:42:38,480
It makes us even more confident.

3293
01:42:38,480 --> 01:42:40,520
Fashion has no borders.

3294
01:42:48,000 --> 01:42:50,040
Thank you to all the new-generation
designers today.

3295
01:42:50,440 --> 01:42:51,960
May you continue to blossom.

3296
01:42:55,960 --> 01:42:57,920
So, everyone,

3297
01:42:57,920 --> 01:42:59,960
our journey in Paris

3298
01:42:59,960 --> 01:43:02,040
is coming to an end for now.

3299
01:43:02,040 --> 01:43:03,480
Here in Paris,

3300
01:43:03,480 --> 01:43:04,840
let's shout out our Earth Group slogan

3301
01:43:04,840 --> 01:43:06,040
for the last time.

3302
01:43:06,560 --> 01:43:08,920
Wow The World!

3303
01:43:08,920 --> 01:43:11,680
The whole world is right here!

3304
01:43:14,600 --> 01:43:15,800
Let's also thank

3305
01:43:15,800 --> 01:43:18,360
Qian for accompanying us
these past few days.

3306
01:43:18,360 --> 01:43:19,680
I hope

3307
01:43:19,680 --> 01:43:21,160
we meet again on the journey.

3308
01:43:29,120 --> 01:43:32,416
(Love within, we cross mountains
and oceans. Beauty has no bounds)

3309
01:43:43,440 --> 01:43:44,760
(Preview)
Welcome to the South of France.

3310
01:43:44,760 --> 01:43:46,480
Today, two new friends

3311
01:43:46,480 --> 01:43:47,160
will join us.

3312
01:43:47,160 --> 01:43:48,440
Hello, everyone.

3313
01:43:48,440 --> 01:43:49,320
I'm here, guys.

3314
01:43:49,400 --> 01:43:50,360
Hello.

3315
01:43:50,760 --> 01:43:51,680
The next mission

3316
01:43:51,680 --> 01:43:53,080
is related to rain scenes.

3317
01:43:54,520 --> 01:43:55,920
This is hard to snatch.

3318
01:43:56,040 --> 01:43:57,280
Nai is really something.

3319
01:44:00,400 --> 01:44:01,160
Not a single line?

3320
01:44:01,160 --> 01:44:02,160
I haven't remembered a single line.

3321
01:44:02,240 --> 01:44:03,160
Come on, Fei.

3322
01:44:03,320 --> 01:44:04,840
So majestic.

3323
01:44:07,560 --> 01:44:08,440
Wait a moment.

3324
01:44:08,680 --> 01:44:09,360
I'll protect you.

3325
01:44:09,760 --> 01:44:11,760
Jin, you're really a genius.

3326
01:44:12,400 --> 01:44:13,200
Let them drift away,

3327
01:44:13,200 --> 01:44:14,120
all the way back to Beijing.

3328
01:44:14,688 --> 01:44:15,392
(Who can complete the mission?)

3329
01:44:16,360 --> 01:44:17,280
The Mediterranean,

3330
01:44:17,280 --> 01:44:18,280
here we come!

3331
01:44:24,288 --> 01:44:25,520
(Stay tuned for Earth Group's
sea project experience)

3332
01:44:25,520 --> 01:44:26,000
Next,

3333
01:44:26,000 --> 01:44:28,000
we'll do a music challenge.

3334
01:44:28,000 --> 01:44:29,400
No technique, all emotion.

3335
01:44:29,400 --> 01:44:30,240
Enough.

3336
01:44:30,400 --> 01:44:31,520
Yuwen,

3337
01:44:31,520 --> 01:44:33,240
you can't bear to hit me, right?

3338
01:44:33,320 --> 01:44:34,160
Lin Yi, you play

3339
01:44:34,160 --> 01:44:34,920
really dirty.

3340
01:44:35,160 --> 01:44:36,800
♪Looking up at the sky♪

3341
01:44:37,240 --> 01:44:38,640
We can be more innocent.

3342
01:44:38,640 --> 01:44:39,960
I'm super innocent.

3343
01:44:40,320 --> 01:44:41,960
♪Looking up at the sky♪

3344
01:44:41,960 --> 01:44:43,120
Yuning, does it sound good?

3345
01:44:43,120 --> 01:44:44,840
These four over here
are indeed very attractive.

3346
01:44:44,840 --> 01:44:46,160
Fei is a little fly.

3347
01:44:46,752 --> 01:44:47,594
(Which group's music will prevail?)

3348
01:44:47,880 --> 01:44:49,120
Among the eight of you,

3349
01:44:49,120 --> 01:44:51,080
there are two "Balloon Spirits".

3350
01:44:51,080 --> 01:44:52,440
Already starting to stir.

3351
01:44:52,440 --> 01:44:53,160
Let's go.

3352
01:44:53,160 --> 01:44:53,880
Let's go. Come on.

3353
01:44:53,880 --> 01:44:55,640
The balloon keeps going backwards.

3354
01:44:55,640 --> 01:44:57,360
I feel like my posture
is hard for me to hold.

3355
01:44:57,360 --> 01:44:58,440
My posture is even harder
for me to hold.

3356
01:44:58,440 --> 01:44:59,400
I saw him throw it.

3357
01:44:59,400 --> 01:45:00,240
You didn't even try.

3358
01:45:00,240 --> 01:45:01,440
Chaoyue, you have to testify for me.

3359
01:45:01,440 --> 01:45:02,480
He looks way too much like a bad guy.

3360
01:45:02,480 --> 01:45:04,520
I suspect Yuning.

3361
01:45:04,576 --> 01:45:05,304
(Who are the Balloon Spirits?)

3362
01:45:05,560 --> 01:45:07,520
Today, all of you need
to work together to make dinner.

3363
01:45:07,520 --> 01:45:08,320
I need scallions.

3364
01:45:08,320 --> 01:45:09,160
Stir-fried cabbage.

3365
01:45:09,160 --> 01:45:10,800
Some mushrooms.

3366
01:45:11,000 --> 01:45:11,560
Goodbye.

3367
01:45:11,560 --> 01:45:12,720
I want to make a Tiger Salad.

3368
01:45:14,840 --> 01:45:16,560
Really, it's already dark.

3369
01:45:16,560 --> 01:45:18,320
I haven't finished my Tiger Salad.

3370
01:45:18,600 --> 01:45:19,480
Pour it in. Pour it in for me.

3371
01:45:21,728 --> 01:45:22,796
(Stay tuned for the Earth Group's feast)

3372
01:45:22,880 --> 01:45:23,920
Don't move with lights on.

3373
01:45:23,920 --> 01:45:25,520
Why am I a bit nervous?

3374
01:45:25,520 --> 01:45:26,272
I've locked onto him.

3375
01:45:26,272 --> 01:45:26,800
Come on.

3376
